Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.06,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,Minecraft中的物品经历过多次更名 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.06,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Minecraft items have been renamed many times.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.32,0:00:05.26,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,末地水晶曾被称为末影水晶 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.32,0:00:05.26,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,End Crystals were called Ender Crystals,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.52,0:00:07.40,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,劫掠兽曾被称为灾厄兽 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.52,0:00:07.40,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Ravagers were called Illager Beasts,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.60,0:00:10.00,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,而深板岩曾被称为幽冥石？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.60,0:00:10.00,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,and Deepslate was called Grimstone?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.24,0:00:14.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,今天我将为大家盘点25个在Minecraft中被重命名的物品 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.24,0:00:14.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,So today, I bring you 25 items that were renamed in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.74,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,回溯Minecraft早期版本 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.74,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.10,0:00:19.56,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,游戏中原本只有两种花卉 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.10,0:00:19.56,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,there used to be only two flowers in the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.12,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,分别是玫瑰与黄色花朵 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.12,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,which was the rose and the yellow flower.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.62,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,在很长一段时间里 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.62,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now, for the longest time,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.72,0:00:26.30,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,黄色花朵仅被称作“花” 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.72,0:00:26.30,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the yellow flower was just called Flower,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但随着1.7版本更新加入了其他花卉
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but when all the other flowers were added in the 1.7 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.04,0:00:33.08,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,它被更名为蒲公英
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.04,0:00:33.08,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the flower was renamed to the dandelion.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.20,0:00:37.42,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,蒲公英这个名称显然比单纯的“花”更具辨识度
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.20,0:00:37.42,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,A dandelion definitely sounds a lot more descriptive than just a flower.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.72,0:00:38.64,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,干草捆
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.72,0:00:38.64,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,The hay bale.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.30,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,众所周知这是个实用方块
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.30,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,We all know it's a useful block,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.10,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,能分解出大量小麦
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.10,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,as you can get a bunch of wheat from it,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,用来制作成堆面包
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,which allows you to make a bunch of bread.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,干草捆在1.6版本加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,The hay bale was added in the 1.6 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.44,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但你们知道它最初并非此名吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.44,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but did you know it wasn't always called this?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.64,0:00:52.94,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,没错 在1.6版本的早期快照阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.64,0:00:52.94,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, during the early snapshot phase for 1.6,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.06,0:00:56.26,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,干草捆最初被称为干草块
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.06,0:00:56.26,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the hay bale was originally called the hay block,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.62,0:00:59.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但在后续的1.6版本快照中
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.62,0:00:59.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but then in a later snapshot for 1.6,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,干草块被更名为干草捆
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the hay block was renamed to the hay bale,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.58,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,并沿用至今
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.58,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,and that's how it's been ever since.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.82,0:01:08.38,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,Minecraft 中有众多铜质方块可选
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.82,0:01:08.38,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, there are loads of different copper-related blocks to choose from,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.60,0:01:12.24,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但最值得关注的是铜块
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.60,0:01:12.24,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but the one copper block to pay attention to is the block of copper,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.46,0:01:13.62,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,原因如下
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.46,0:01:13.62,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,and here is why.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.78,0:01:18.40,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,当铜块在1.17洞穴与山崖更新中加入时
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.78,0:01:18.40,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,So when the block of copper was added in the 1.17 caves and cliffs update,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.56,0:01:22.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,快照版本中原本命名为“铜块”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.56,0:01:22.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,it was originally called the copper block in the snapshot,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.46,0:01:25.62,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但在后续1.17快照中
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.46,0:01:25.62,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but then in a later snapshot for the 1.17 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这个方块从“铜块”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the copper block was renamed from being called the,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.86,0:01:31.96,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,更名为“铜质方块”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.86,0:01:31.96,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,well, copper block, to the block of copper.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.20,0:01:36.04,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,我知道 这简直是游戏史上最有趣的改动
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.20,0:01:36.04,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,I know, I know, that was the most interesting change in Minecraft history.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.26,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,言归正传
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.26,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.38,0:01:38.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,在Java版中
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.38,0:01:38.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Java Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.08,0:01:43.00,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,熟猪肉被称为“熟猪排”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.08,0:01:43.00,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,a pork chop when it's simply called cooked pork chop.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.14,0:01:44.72,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,而在基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.14,0:01:44.72,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But in Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.92,0:01:49.44,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,不知何故被命名为“熟牛肉”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.92,0:01:49.44,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the cooked pork chop for whatever reason was renamed to say cooked beef.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.72,0:01:52.88,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,为何同一食物在两个平台会有不同名称
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.72,0:01:52.88,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Why this food item has a different name between the two platforms,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.08,0:01:53.76,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,至今无人知晓
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.08,0:01:53.76,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,I'll never know.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.96,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,众所周知游戏中有西瓜籽
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.96,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,So we all know in Minecraft we have the melon seeds,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.44,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,西瓜片和西瓜块
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.44,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the melon slice, and the melon block.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.76,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但你们是否知道长久以来
Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.76,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But did you know for the longest time,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.88,0:02:06.30,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,西瓜片与西瓜块都统称为“西瓜”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.88,0:02:06.30,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,both the melon slice and the melon block were both just simply called melon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.66,0:02:09.24,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,直到1.13海洋更新
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.66,0:02:09.24,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then in the 1.13 aquatic update,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.94,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,可食用的部分才从“西瓜”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.94,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the melon that you can eat was renamed from being called melon,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.48,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,更名为“西瓜片”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.48,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,to the melon slice.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.80,0:02:19.60,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,龟壳可用于制作海龟帽
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.80,0:02:19.60,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,So we all know the turtle scute is used to craft a turtle shell,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.76,0:02:23.70,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,佩戴后能延长水下呼吸时间
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.76,0:02:23.70,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,which can be worn by the player and allows them to breathe underwater for longer.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.04,0:02:28.06,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但你们知道它最初并非此名吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.04,0:02:28.06,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,However, did you know the turtle scute wasn't always called this?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.22,0:02:32.66,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,当龟壳最初出现在1.13快照版时
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.22,0:02:32.66,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, when the turtle scute was first added in the 1.13 snapshot,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.00,0:02:36.12,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,它原本被命名为“龟壳碎片”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.00,0:02:36.12,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,it was originally called the turtle shell piece.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.36,0:02:39.10,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但在后续的1.13快照中
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.36,0:02:39.10,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then in a later snapshot for 1.13,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.36,0:02:44.04,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,又从“龟壳碎片”更名为“鳞甲”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.36,0:02:44.04,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,it was renamed from a turtle shell piece to simply be called a scute.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.34,0:02:45.44,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,故事并未结束
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.34,0:02:45.44,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't end there,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.54,0:02:47.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,在1.20.5版本更新中
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.54,0:02:47.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,as in the 1.20.5 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.80,0:02:51.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,它再次被更名为“海龟鳞甲”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.80,0:02:51.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the scute was renamed to be called the turtle scute,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.22,0:02:53.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,并沿用至今
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.22,0:02:53.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,and that's what it's been called ever since.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.50,0:02:59.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,刷怪笼早在2010年的infdev阶段就已加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.50,0:02:59.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,The monster spawner was added into Minecraft in the infdev phase all the way back in 2010.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.52,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,它们与地牢同时问世
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.52,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,They were added alongside dungeons,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.66,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,当时地牢是游戏中唯一的建筑结构
Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.66,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,which were the only structure in Minecraft at the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.88,0:03:10.34,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,在旧版本中获取刷怪笼的唯一方式是通过指令
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.88,0:03:10.34,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now the only way to obtain the monster spawner in old versions of Minecraft was by using commands,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.50,0:03:15.16,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这个方块当时的物品名称是“怪物刷怪笼”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.50,0:03:15.16,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,and as you can see, the item name for the block at the time was monster spawner.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.26,0:03:16.76,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但不知出于何种原因
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.26,0:03:16.76,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then, for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.98,0:03:19.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,在1.13海洋更新中
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.98,0:03:19.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,in the 1.13 aquatic update,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.16,0:03:22.90,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,它被简化为“刷怪笼”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.16,0:03:22.90,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the monster spawner was renamed to simply say spawner.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.06,0:03:26.62,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,而后在1.19.3的某个快照中
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.06,0:03:26.62,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then in a random snapshot for 1.19.3,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.84,0:03:29.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,又改回了“怪物刷怪笼”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.84,0:03:29.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the spawner was renamed back to monster spawner.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.52,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,或许是觉得“刷怪笼”这个名称过于单调
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.52,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,I guess the name spawner was a bit too boring,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.74,0:03:34.12,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,所以恢复了原来的叫法
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.74,0:03:34.12,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,so they changed it back.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.30,0:03:37.88,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,各位观众 接下来这个物品重命名堪称重磅
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.30,0:03:37.88,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Okay guys, this next item rename is a huge one,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.98,0:03:43.50,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,因为大箱子在1.3正式版中被更名为“大箱子”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.98,0:03:43.50,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,because the large chest was renamed to the large chest in release 1.3.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.32,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,没错 在1.3版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.32,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, in 1.3,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.48,0:03:49.66,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,大箱子界面标题的首字母改成了大写
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.48,0:03:49.66,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the large chest inventory title was changed to capital C,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.88,0:03:52.40,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这可谓是我的世界划时代的改动
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.88,0:03:52.40,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,which is a massive change from Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.04,0:03:57.30,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,劫掠兽是在1.14村庄与掠夺更新中加入的
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.04,0:03:57.30,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,The ravager was added in the 1.14 village and pillage update.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.54,0:04:01.94,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这种凶残生物确实能让你吃尽苦头
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.54,0:04:01.94,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now the ravager is indeed a very scary mob that can mess you up pretty bad,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但可知它最初并非叫这个名字？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but did you know it wasn't always called the ravager?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.90,0:04:09.34,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,没错 在1.14村庄与掠夺更新的快照阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.90,0:04:09.34,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, during the snapshot phase for the 1.14 village and pillage update,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.52,0:04:12.98,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,劫掠兽最初被命名为“灾厄兽”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.52,0:04:12.98,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the ravager was originally called the illager beast.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.18,0:04:16.48,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,由于这个命名渊源
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.18,0:04:16.48,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Since the ravager was originally called the illager beast,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.64,0:04:19.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,其刷怪蛋也沿用了这个名称
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.64,0:04:19.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the spawn egg for the mob was also called this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.50,0:04:22.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但在后续的1.14快照中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.50,0:04:22.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then in a later snapshot for 1.14,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.64,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,“灾厄兽”被正式更名为“劫掠兽”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.64,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the illager beast was officially renamed to the ravager,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.80,0:04:28.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,相应的刷怪蛋也随之改名
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.80,0:04:28.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,which meant the spawn egg was renamed as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.60,0:04:33.84,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,砂岩早在2011年的Beta1.2版本就已加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.60,0:04:33.84,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Sandstone was added into Minecraft in beta 1.2 in 2011,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.24,0:04:38.96,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但砂岩变体直到2012年的1.2正式版才问世
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.24,0:04:38.96,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,but we didn't get the sandstone variant until release 1.2 in 2012.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.54,0:04:42.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,有趣的是在1.2正式版时期
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.54,0:04:42.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,What's interesting is during release 1.2,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.36,0:04:49.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,砂岩及其所有变体都共用“砂岩”这个统一名称
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.36,0:04:49.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,sandstone along with its variants did not have unique item names and instead all shared the name sandstone.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.32,0:04:55.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,直到1.3正式版更新时 所有砂岩变体才获得了专属的物品名称 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.32,0:04:55.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,It wasn't until release 1.3 where all the sandstone variants were given their own unique item names.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.82,0:05:00.42,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,尽管砂岩变体在1.3版本已拥有独立名称 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.82,0:05:00.42,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now despite the sandstone variants receiving their own names in version 1.3,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.60,0:05:07.48,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但平滑砂岩在1.13海洋更新中被更名为“切制砂岩"”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.60,0:05:07.48,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the smooth sandstone block was eventually renamed to cut sandstone in the 1.13 aquatic update.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.48,0:05:15.42,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这很可能是因为在1.5正式版中新增了另一种平滑砂岩——当你在熔炉中
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.48,0:05:15.42,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs45}This was likely done as another smooth sandstone block was added in release 1.5 where if you smelted sandstone in a
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.42,0:05:18.82,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,烧炼普通砂岩时 会获得另一种名为“平滑砂岩”的方块 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.42,0:05:18.82,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,furnace, you would get another block called smooth sandstone.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.02,0:05:24.38,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,确实 如果存在两种都叫“平滑砂岩”的方块 势必会造成混淆 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.02,0:05:24.38,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,So yeah, it definitely would have been very confusing if there were two sandstone blocks called smooth sandstone.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.64,0:05:29.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,不仅平滑砂岩在1.13版本更名 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.64,0:05:29.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Not only was smooth sandstone renamed to cut sandstone in 1.13,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.66,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,红色砂岩变体也经历了改名 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.66,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the red variant of the sandstone block was also renamed.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.70,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,没错 在海洋更新中 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.70,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, in the aquatic update,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.84,0:05:38.58,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,平滑红色砂岩被重新命名为“切制红色砂岩”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.84,0:05:38.58,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the smooth red sandstone was renamed to cut red sandstone.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.84,0:05:45.54,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,深板岩是一种生成于主世界深层地下的岩石类型 其功能与普通岩石相似 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:38.84,0:05:45.54,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs45}Deepslate is a stone type found deep underground in the overworld and it functions similar to regular stone but it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.54,0:05:47.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但挖掘耗时显著更长 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.54,0:05:47.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,significantly longer to break.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.82,0:05:54.74,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,深板岩虽在1.17洞穴与山崖更新中加入 但可知它并非始终叫这个名字？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.82,0:05:54.74,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now deepslate was added in the 1.17 caves and cliffs update but did you know it wasn't always called deepslate?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.92,0:05:59.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,事实上 在1.17更新的早期快照阶段 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.92,0:05:59.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, during the early snapshot phase for the 1.17 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.34,0:06:02.94,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,该方块原本被命名为“幽冥岩”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.34,0:06:02.94,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the deepslate block was originally called grimstone.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.74,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,而在后续的1.17快照中 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.74,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then in a later snapshot for 1.17,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.74,0:06:12.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,不仅深板岩的纹理与模型被调整 其名称也从“幽冥岩”变更为“深板岩”
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.74,0:06:12.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the texture and model of deepslate was changed as well as being renamed from grimstone to deepslate.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.32,0:06:15.12,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,据开发者Brandon Pearce解释 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.32,0:06:15.12,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now according to Minecraft developer Brandon Pearce,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.30,0:06:22.81,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,更名原因是“幽冥”一词蕴含过多负面情感联想 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.30,0:06:22.81,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}the reason for changing the name grimstone to deepslate was because the word grim had too many connotations related to a negative feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.86,0:06:28.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs52}他还说明最终选定“深板岩”这个名称既体现了其在地下深处的生成位置
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.86,0:06:28.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,He also stated that the name deepslate was eventually chosen because of its location within the world and it more
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.68,0:06:31.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,又更准确地表明这是一种板岩材质
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.68,0:06:31.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,accurately represented that it is a type of slate.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.86,0:06:36.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,我欣赏开发团队坦言“幽冥岩”听起来更酷的说法 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.86,0:06:36.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,I like that they also stated that grimstone sounded cooler because I do agree,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.52,0:06:43.61,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs55}就方块名称而言 我也认为幽冥岩确实比深板岩更显酷炫 但深板岩确实更能准确体现该方块特性 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.52,0:06:43.61,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs33}I think grimstone does sound cooler than deepslate as block names go but deepslate definitely represents the block a lot better.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.48,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,小麦种子
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.48,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Wheat seeds.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.66,0:06:49.80,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,我们都使用过它们 播种 等待生长 最终制成面包
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.66,0:06:49.80,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,We've all used them, you plant them and then they grow and then you make some bread with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.92,0:06:55.46,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但是否知道在1.13海洋更新之前 小麦种子始终被简称为“种子”？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.92,0:06:55.46,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But did you know that the wheat seeds before the 1.13 aquatic update were just called seeds?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.78,0:06:58.12,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,没错 这个冷知识确实很有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.78,0:06:58.12,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Yeah I know, that's really interesting isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.18,0:07:05.54,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,在某个1.13快照中 种子被正式更名为小麦种子 整段历史大致如此 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.18,0:07:05.54,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs40}But uh yeah, in a random snapshot for 1.13 the seeds were renamed to wheat seeds and uh yeah that's uh pretty much it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.62,0:07:10.90,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,话说回来 在荒野更新中青蛙与蝌蚪 青蛙卵同步加入游戏 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:05.62,0:07:10.90,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Anyways moving on, frogs along with tadpoles and frogspawn were added in the wild update.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.24,0:07:18.26,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但是否知道基岩版荒野更新测试阶段 青蛙卵曾使用过不同名称？ 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.24,0:07:18.26,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}But did you know in the experiment phase for the wild update in bedrock edition frogspawn actually had a different name?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.44,0:07:23.48,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,没错 当时不叫“青蛙卵”而称作“蛙蛋”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.44,0:07:23.48,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,That's right, instead of being called frogspawn it was instead called frog egg.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.72,0:07:29.20,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,不过在后续测试版本中 “蛙蛋”被更名为“青蛙卵”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.72,0:07:29.20,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But then in a later experiment test build the frog egg was renamed to frogspawn.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.34,0:07:35.40,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,故事尚未结束——就在基岩版荒野更新即将发布时 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.34,0:07:35.40,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}But it doesn't end there because right as the wild update was going to be released for bedrock edition the frogspawn was
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.40,0:07:40.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,原本由两个单词组成的“青蛙卵”又被合并成了单个单词 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.40,0:07:40.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,renamed once again to just be one word as it was two words before.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.40,0:07:47.68,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,胡萝卜早在2012年的1.4版本就已加入游戏 请注意我使用的是复数形式 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.40,0:07:47.68,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Carrots were added in the Minecraft 1.4 update all the way back in 2012 and yes I did say carrots plural as the old
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.68,0:07:51.64,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,因为旧版纹理呈现的是一捆胡萝卜而非单根 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.68,0:07:51.64,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,texture used to be a bunch of instead of just a single carrot.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.04,0:08:00.19,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}这也体现在物品名称上——当使用该纹理时物品栏显示的是复数而非单数形式
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.04,0:08:00.19,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}This also reflected in its item name as when the carrots had this texture it was called carrots in the inventory instead of carrot.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.28,0:08:09.16,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}随后在1.4的更新中 胡萝卜纹理改为单根 物品名称也从复数改为单数形式
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.28,0:08:09.16,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs40}But then in a later update for 1.4 the carrot texture was changed to be a single carrot and the item was renamed from carrots to carrot.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.30,0:08:12.40,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,天啊 我刚才到底说了多少次胡萝卜？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:09.30,0:08:12.40,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Oh my god how many times did I say carrot just then?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.52,0:08:18.82,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,话说回来 灵魂火把作为蓝色火把变种 是在1.16下界更新中加入的 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.52,0:08:18.82,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Anyways moving on, the soul torch is a blue torch variant that was added in the 1.16 nether update.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.82,0:08:26.93,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但你是否知道 在1.16下界更新的快照阶段被叫做“灵魂火火把”
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.82,0:08:26.93,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}But did you know during the snapshot phase for the 1.16 nether update the soul torch was instead called the soul fire torch.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.12,0:08:34.38,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs73}这个名称并未沿用太久 在后续的1.16快照中“灵魂火火把”就更名为灵魂火把 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.12,0:08:34.38,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,This didn't last too long as in a later snapshot for 1.16 the soul fire torch was renamed to the soul torch.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.62,0:08:42.99,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs65}同样的情况也发生在灵魂灯笼上——在1.16版本快照阶段 它原本被称为灵魂火灯笼 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.62,0:08:42.99,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs40}The same also applies to the soul lantern as during the snapshot phase for the 1.16 update it was instead called the soul fire lantern.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.80,0:08:50.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,棕色蘑菇和红色蘑菇几乎从创世之初就存在于我的世界中
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.80,0:08:50.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}The brown mushroom and the red mushroom have been in Minecraft since pretty much the beginning of time as they were
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.14,0:08:53.44,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,早在2009年的classic版本阶段就已加入游戏 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.14,0:08:53.44,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,added all the way back in the classic phase in 2009.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.88,0:08:59.98,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,长久以来 棕色蘑菇和红色蘑菇在物品栏中都只被统称为“蘑菇”
Dialogue: 2,0:08:53.88,0:08:59.98,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now for the longest time both the brown and red mushroom were just called mushroom in the inventory.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.52,0:09:09.09,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,随后在1.13海洋更新中 蘑菇的名称被改为棕色蘑菇与红色蘑菇
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.52,0:09:09.09,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs33}But then in the 1.13 aquatic update the names of the mushrooms were changed to be called the brown mushroom and the red mushroom respectively.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.14,0:09:15.08,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,众所周知 在如今的我的世界中 黏土球与黏土块各有其名 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:09.14,0:09:15.08,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,So we all know in Minecraft today the clay ball and the clay block have their own different names.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.08,0:09:16.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,黏土球曾叫做
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.08,0:09:16.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,The clay ball is called,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.98,0:09:20.64,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,黏土球 与黏土块都统称为黏土 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.98,0:09:20.64,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,well, clay ball and the clay block is simply called clay.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.90,0:09:27.96,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,但在1.16下界更新前的早期版本中 这两种方块都统称为黏土
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.90,0:09:27.96,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But back in the earlier days of Minecraft before the 1.16 nether update both of these blocks were simply called clay.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.30,0:09:36.52,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,2013年的1.7版本更新中新增了一种可用钓竿捕获的鱼类
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.30,0:09:36.52,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}In the 1.7 update in 2013 Minecraft added a new fish type that you could catch with a fishing rod and this new fish was
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.52,0:09:37.70,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,小丑鱼 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.52,0:09:37.70,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,the clownfish.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.96,0:09:45.88,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这些年来小丑鱼基本保持不变 直到1.13海洋更新才发生改变 事情是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.96,0:09:45.88,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs40}Now the clownfish remained mostly unchanged over the years but this all changed in the 1.13 aquatic update and here is why.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.96,0:09:55.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs70}1.13海洋更新加入了多种在水中游弋的新鱼类 其中你能找到的一种鱼就是热带鱼
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.96,0:09:55.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs40}So the 1.13 aquatic update added a bunch of new fish to swim around in the water and one of the fish types you can find are tropical fish.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.22,0:10:00.62,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,众所周知 当你击杀热带鱼生物时 它们会掉落作为物品的热带鱼
Dialogue: 2,0:09:55.22,0:10:00.62,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Now as you know when you kill a tropical fish mob it will drop a tropical fish as an item.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.84,0:10:08.46,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs75}但你是否知道 这个热带鱼物品最初是小丑鱼 因为在1.13的快照阶段 这种鱼
Dialogue: 2,0:10:00.84,0:10:08.46,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,But did you know this tropical fish item was originally the clownfish as in the snapshot phase for 1.13 this fish was
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.46,0:10:11.36,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,从“小丑鱼”更名为“热带鱼” 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.46,0:10:11.36,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,renamed from clownfish to tropical fish.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.52,0:10:18.28,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs70}说真的 每次看到这个热带鱼纹理 我总会想起《海底总动员》里的小丑鱼马林 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:11.52,0:10:18.28,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,I mean I'll be real whenever I look at this tropical fish texture I just think of Marlin the clownfish from Finding Nemo.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.34,0:10:23.18,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,末影水晶是矗立于黑曜石柱顶端的实体 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.34,0:10:23.18,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,End crystals are entities that are found on top of obsidian pillars.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.86,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,摧毁末影水晶能帮助你击败末影龙 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.86,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Destroying them helps you defeat the ender dragon.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.22,0:10:31.80,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,末影水晶也能被合成物品形态 让玩家能够重新召唤末影龙 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.22,0:10:31.80,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,End crystals can also be crafted into item form that allows the player to respawn the dragon as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.06,0:10:38.92,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,早在2011年的beta1.9版本中加入时 这些实体原本被称为“末地水晶”
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.06,0:10:38.92,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,When end crystals were added all the way back in beta 1.9 in 2011 they were instead called ender crystals.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.34,0:10:46.14,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,这个名称一直沿用到1.9战斗更新版本 才最终更名为
Dialogue: 2,0:10:39.34,0:10:46.14,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}These entities were called ender crystals all the way up to the 1.9 combat update where they were finally renamed to the
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.02,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,“末影水晶”并沿用至今 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.02,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,end crystals and that's how they've been ever since.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.26,0:10:52.20,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,我的世界中还有更多物品经历过重命名 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:49.26,0:10:52.20,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,There are many more items that were renamed in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.60,0:10:54.98,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,如果你们想看第二部分请告诉我 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.60,0:10:54.98,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,let me know if you want to see a part 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.18,0:10:55.90,Default-s-cn-1080,,0,0,0,,那么下次见！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.18,0:10:55.90,Default-en-1080,,0,0,0,,Anyways bye!
